# Agent Skills (Workspace)

Skills are cortex-resident at `agent-skills/` (cortex sandbox), workspace-agnostic and shared across every team seat (web, api, cursor*, grok-direct, gemini-*). Check before manually re-deriving an ingestion procedure or tool pattern the team has encountered before.

**Invariant**: ∀ non-standard document type or tool pattern (financial statements, legal filings, insurance docs, frontier dispatch, browser sessions, …): read the relevant skill before attempting the operation; ¬ re-derive what is already documented. The boot manifest surfaces every registered skill at session start — scan it before acting on unfamiliar territory.

Index / discovery:
```
fs(sandbox="cortex", op="list", path="agent-skills")
fs(sandbox="cortex", op="read", path="agent-skills/README.md")
cortex(tool="entities", arguments='{"type": "agent_skill"}')
```
